OL,3,GNEWSARecord half marathon hopes for dad
OL,4,Aliving with MS
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-two is waiting for
OL,7,Fconfirmation that he has broken a
OL,8,FGuinness World Record after completing
OL,9,Fa half marathon despite living with
OL,10,Fmultiple sclerosis.
OL,12,FAt the ASICS Manchester Half Marathon,
OL,13,Fwhich took place earlier, David Price
OL,14,Fran 13.1 miles (21km) in one hour, 30
OL,15,Fminutes and 30 seconds as a record
OL,16,F23,000 people took part in the event.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
