OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARecord half marathon hopes for dad
OL,4,Aliving with MS
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Liverpool runner is confident he
OL,7,Fhas beaten the previous mark, held by
OL,8,FChris White, by 16 seconds after
OL,9,Fsetting himself the challenge of
OL,10,Fbecoming the fastest man with the
OL,11,Fcondition to complete the distance.
OL,13,FPrice said: "I can stand here today
OL,14,Fabsolutely ecstatic that I managed to
OL,15,Fbeat it."
